  "note": "Each film is a self-contained case, so you can start almost anywhere. There was no film in 2020 — The Scarlet Bullet was delayed a year by the pandemic. A handful move the wider story about the Black Organisation forward, and those are the ones long-time fans point newcomers towards rather than starting at 1997. Known as Case Closed in North America. There are also several television specials and a crossover with Lupin III, none of which are counted among the numbered films."
